mxml: Mini-XML is a tiny XML library that you can use to read and write XML
mxml: and XML-like data files in your application without requiring large
mxml: non-standard libraries.
mxml: Mini-XML supports reading of UTF-8 and UTF-16 and writing of UTF-8
mxml: encoded XML files and strings.
mxml: Element names, attributes, and attribute values are supported with
mxml: no preset limits, just available memory.
